Browser-level CDP recorder upgrade
==================================

Previous mode:
- attach to one page WebSocket
- captured ChatGPT and Midtrans bodies
- missed api.stripe.com requests emitted by Stripe iframe/OOPIF targets

Current mode:
- connect to browser WebSocket from /json/version
- Target.setDiscoverTargets(discover=true)
- Target.setAutoAttach(autoAttach=true, waitForDebuggerOnStart=false, flatten=true)
- attach Network/Fetch/Runtime to page, iframe, worker, service_worker and shared_worker targets
- route flattened CDP session events into per-target HARRecorder instances
- merge all target entries into one local HAR

New browser port reserved by user:
127.0.0.1:58868

Capture is not started until the user sends the start instruction.
